msgid "Where tags label an event, galaxies connect it to known things: threat actors, malware families, ATT&amp;CK techniques."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:666
msgid "Attach the right cluster and your event joins everything else attributed to that actor."
msgstr ""

#: Lib/Tools/OnboardingTour.php:674
msgid "Attach a cluster"
